[
 {
  "t0": 0.95,
  "t1": 2.33,
  "text": "What if you woke up tomorrow and your"
 },
 {
  "t0": 2.37,
  "t1": 4.51,
  "text": "brain suddenly unlocked one hundred"
 },
 {
  "t0": 4.55,
  "t1": 5.75,
  "text": "percent of its full potential?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 5.907,
  "t1": 7.527,
  "text": "You could memorize entire books,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 7.567,
  "t1": 9.667,
  "text": "solve complicated equations in seconds,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 9.707,
  "t1": 10.887,
  "text": "and learn new languages faster"
 },
 {
  "t0": 10.927,
  "t1": 12.387,
  "text": "than a toddler learns to scream"
 },
 {
  "t0": 12.427,
  "t1": 13.627,
  "text": "in a supermarket."
 },
 {
  "t0": 13.737,
  "t1": 15.467,
  "text": "You might even become smarter than Einstein."
 },
 {
  "t0": 16.8,
  "t1": 18.41,
  "text": "You could predict people's behavior,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 18.5,
  "t1": 20.13,
  "text": "understand complex emotions,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 20.22,
  "t1": 21.48,
  "text": "and solve problems that ordinary"
 },
 {
  "t0": 21.52,
  "t1": 23.49,
  "text": "humans couldn't even imagine."
 },
 {
  "t0": 23.656,
  "t1": 24.616,
  "text": "You'd basically become a"
 },
 {
  "t0": 24.656,
  "t1": 25.886,
  "text": "walking supercomputer."
 },
 {
  "t0": 26.575,
  "t1": 27.438,
  "text": "Except\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 27.478,
  "t1": 28.678,
  "text": "There's still one problem."
 },
 {
  "t0": 29.219,
  "t1": 30.25,
  "text": "Your girlfriend."
 },
 {
  "t0": 30.29,
  "t1": 31.47,
  "text": "Because no matter how powerful"
 },
 {
  "t0": 31.51,
  "t1": 32.65,
  "text": "your brain becomes,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 32.69,
  "t1": 34.15,
  "text": "there's one mysterious creature whose"
 },
 {
  "t0": 34.19,
  "t1": 35.77,
  "text": "messages might still crash your"
 },
 {
  "t0": 35.81,
  "t1": 37.54,
  "text": "entire operating system."
 },
 {
  "t0": 38.8,
  "t1": 40.066,
  "text": "But before we get to that\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 40.106,
  "t1": 41.126,
  "text": "Let's find out what would actually"
 },
 {
  "t0": 41.166,
  "t1": 42.746,
  "text": "happen if your brain reached its"
 },
 {
  "t0": 42.786,
  "t1": 43.986,
  "text": "maximum potential."
 },
 {
  "t0": 45.75,
  "t1": 46.565,
  "text": "Day one."
 },
 {
  "t0": 46.605,
  "t1": 47.885,
  "text": "You wake up, look at your phone,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 47.925,
  "t1": 49.515,
  "text": "and suddenly remember everything."
 },
 {
  "t0": 49.704,
  "t1": 51.864,
  "text": "Every conversation, every book you've read,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 51.904,
  "t1": 54.274,
  "text": "every password you've forgotten since 2012."
 },
 {
  "t0": 54.466,
  "t1": 56.516,
  "text": "Your memory is now ridiculously powerful."
 },
 {
  "t0": 57.8,
  "t1": 59.02,
  "text": "Normally, your brain constantly"
 },
 {
  "t0": 59.06,
  "t1": 60.26,
  "text": "filters information,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 60.38,
  "t1": 62.55,
  "text": "keeping some memories and discarding others."
 },
 {
  "t0": 62.743,
  "t1": 63.963,
  "text": "But imagine being able to recall"
 },
 {
  "t0": 64.003,
  "t1": 65.583,
  "text": "almost every detail with"
 },
 {
  "t0": 65.623,
  "t1": 66.913,
  "text": "incredible accuracy."
 },
 {
  "t0": 68.3,
  "t1": 69.95,
  "text": "You read a three-hundred-page book once."
 },
 {
  "t0": 70.909,
  "t1": 71.561,
  "text": "Done."
 },
 {
  "t0": 71.601,
  "t1": 73.381,
  "text": "You remember the characters, the story,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 73.421,
  "t1": 76.251,
  "text": "and even that suspicious typo on page 147."
 },
 {
  "t0": 77.8,
  "t1": 79.0,
  "text": "You walk into an exam."
 },
 {
  "t0": 79.113,
  "t1": 80.523,
  "text": "The teacher asks a question."
 },
 {
  "t0": 80.788,
  "t1": 81.918,
  "text": "You close your eyes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 81.958,
  "t1": 83.138,
  "text": "And suddenly, the entire textbook"
 },
 {
  "t0": 83.178,
  "t1": 84.668,
  "text": "appears inside your head."
 },
 {
  "t0": 84.724,
  "t1": 86.494,
  "text": "You answer every question perfectly."
 },
 {
  "t0": 86.775,
  "t1": 88.145,
  "text": "Your classmates stare at you."
 },
 {
  "t0": 88.211,
  "t1": 90.141,
  "text": "The teacher starts questioning your existence."
 },
 {
  "t0": 91.25,
  "t1": 92.053,
  "text": "But then\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 92.093,
  "t1": 93.583,
  "text": "Your girlfriend sends you a message."
 },
 {
  "t0": 94.337,
  "t1": 95.3,
  "text": "\"Fine.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 95.34,
  "t1": 96.54,
  "text": "Just one word."
 },
 {
  "t0": 96.95,
  "t1": 98.05,
  "text": "You immediately activate your"
 },
 {
  "t0": 98.09,
  "t1": 99.268,
  "text": "upgraded memory."
 },
 {
  "t0": 99.308,
  "t1": 100.428,
  "text": "You search through thousands of"
 },
 {
  "t0": 100.468,
  "t1": 101.738,
  "text": "previous conversations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 101.983,
  "t1": 102.903,
  "text": "Three months ago, she said"
 },
 {
  "t0": 102.943,
  "t1": 104.353,
  "text": "\"fine\" with a heart emoji."
 },
 {
  "t0": 104.623,
  "t1": 105.683,
  "text": "Two weeks ago, she said \"fine\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 105.723,
  "t1": 107.253,
  "text": "followed by a full stop."
 },
 {
  "t0": 107.502,
  "t1": 109.342,
  "text": "Yesterday, she said \"fine\" after you forgot"
 },
 {
  "t0": 109.382,
  "t1": 110.892,
  "text": "to compliment her new haircut."
 },
 {
  "t0": 111.102,
  "t1": 113.582,
  "text": "You analyze the punctuation, message timing,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 113.622,
  "t1": 115.652,
  "text": "previous arguments, and even the weather."
 },
 {
  "t0": 115.757,
  "t1": 117.587,
  "text": "After seventeen minutes of calculations,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 117.797,
  "t1": 119.407,
  "text": "your brain produces a result."
 },
 {
  "t0": 119.511,
  "t1": 121.401,
  "text": "Danger level: 98.7 percent."
 },
 {
  "t0": 122.8,
  "t1": 124.0,
  "text": "You reply:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 124.121,
  "t1": 124.945,
  "text": "\"Are you sure?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 124.985,
  "t1": 126.185,
  "text": "She replies:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 126.486,
  "t1": 127.686,
  "text": "\"Whatever.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 127.932,
  "t1": 129.132,
  "text": "Your brain crashes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 129.687,
  "t1": 130.887,
  "text": "Congratulations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 131.069,
  "t1": 131.989,
  "text": "You can remember the entire"
 },
 {
  "t0": 132.029,
  "t1": 133.479,
  "text": "history of humanity,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 133.549,
  "t1": 135.029,
  "text": "but apparently, you still need a PhD"
 },
 {
  "t0": 135.069,
  "t1": 137.179,
  "text": "in girlfriend communication."
 },
 {
  "t0": 139.85,
  "t1": 141.05,
  "text": "Next, your thinking speed."
 },
 {
  "t0": 141.239,
  "t1": 142.859,
  "text": "Your brain processes enormous amounts"
 },
 {
  "t0": 142.899,
  "t1": 144.519,
  "text": "of information every second,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 144.559,
  "t1": 145.439,
  "text": "but conscious thinking and"
 },
 {
  "t0": 145.479,
  "t1": 147.169,
  "text": "decision-making have their own limitations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 148.002,
  "t1": 149.362,
  "text": "Now imagine your brain becoming"
 },
 {
  "t0": 149.402,
  "t1": 151.042,
  "text": "incredibly efficient at recognizing"
 },
 {
  "t0": 151.082,
  "t1": 153.272,
  "text": "patterns and connecting information."
 },
 {
  "t0": 154.3,
  "t1": 155.57,
  "text": "Let's test this with chess."
 },
 {
  "t0": 155.696,
  "t1": 157.476,
  "text": "An ordinary player looks at the board and"
 },
 {
  "t0": 157.516,
  "t1": 159.286,
  "text": "considers a few possible moves."
 },
 {
  "t0": 159.511,
  "t1": 160.731,
  "text": "A professional chess player can"
 },
 {
  "t0": 160.771,
  "t1": 162.451,
  "text": "recognize familiar patterns and"
 },
 {
  "t0": 162.491,
  "t1": 164.721,
  "text": "anticipate several possible responses."
 },
 {
  "t0": 165.038,
  "t1": 166.458,
  "text": "But with your upgraded brain?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 166.498,
  "t1": 167.518,
  "text": "You examine the board,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 167.558,
  "t1": 169.028,
  "text": "calculate possible strategies,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 169.218,
  "t1": 170.398,
  "text": "and predict your opponent's mistakes"
 },
 {
  "t0": 170.438,
  "t1": 172.308,
  "text": "before they even touch a piece."
 },
 {
  "t0": 173.45,
  "t1": 174.66,
  "text": "Your opponent moves a pawn."
 },
 {
  "t0": 174.908,
  "t1": 176.089,
  "text": "You smile."
 },
 {
  "t0": 176.129,
  "t1": 177.439,
  "text": "Checkmate in twelve moves."
 },
 {
  "t0": 177.596,
  "t1": 178.796,
  "text": "He starts sweating."
 },
 {
  "t0": 179.8,
  "t1": 181.0,
  "text": "Then he asks for a rematch."
 },
 {
  "t0": 181.194,
  "t1": 182.844,
  "text": "You calculate another twelve moves."
 },
 {
  "t0": 183.036,
  "t1": 184.926,
  "text": "He starts questioning his career choices."
 },
 {
  "t0": 185.172,
  "t1": 186.612,
  "text": "At this point, even a chess computer"
 },
 {
  "t0": 186.652,
  "t1": 188.042,
  "text": "might need a coffee break."
 },
 {
  "t0": 189.3,
  "t1": 191.16,
  "text": "Feeling unstoppable, you decide to test your"
 },
 {
  "t0": 191.2,
  "t1": 193.43,
  "text": "processing speed on something even harder."
 },
 {
  "t0": 193.638,
  "t1": 194.77,
  "text": "Your girlfriend asks:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 194.81,
  "t1": 196.34,
  "text": "\"Do you think I look fat in this dress?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 196.567,
  "t1": 197.827,
  "text": "Your brain immediately activates"
 },
 {
  "t0": 197.867,
  "t1": 199.577,
  "text": "every available processor."
 },
 {
  "t0": 199.851,
  "t1": 201.511,
  "text": "You calculate her facial expression,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 201.551,
  "t1": 203.711,
  "text": "the dress design, previous conversations,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 203.751,
  "t1": 205.391,
  "text": "emotional context, and the possible"
 },
 {
  "t0": 205.431,
  "t1": 207.281,
  "text": "consequences of every answer."
 },
 {
  "t0": 208.3,
  "t1": 209.5,
  "text": "Option A: Tell the truth."
 },
 {
  "t0": 209.639,
  "t1": 211.189,
  "text": "Option B: Say she looks beautiful."
 },
 {
  "t0": 211.447,
  "t1": 212.667,
  "text": "Option C: Pretend you didn't"
 },
 {
  "t0": 212.707,
  "t1": 213.722,
  "text": "hear the question."
 },
 {
  "t0": 213.762,
  "t1": 214.682,
  "text": "Your brain simulates ten"
 },
 {
  "t0": 214.722,
  "t1": 216.172,
  "text": "million possible outcomes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 216.418,
  "t1": 218.228,
  "text": "And finally, it chooses option B."
 },
 {
  "t0": 218.655,
  "t1": 219.712,
  "text": "\"You look beautiful.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 219.752,
  "t1": 220.952,
  "text": "She responds:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 221.166,
  "t1": 222.976,
  "text": "\"So you're saying I looked ugly yesterday?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 223.67,
  "t1": 224.698,
  "text": "System error."
 },
 {
  "t0": 224.738,
  "t1": 225.938,
  "text": "No solution found."
 },
 {
  "t0": 227.85,
  "t1": 229.56,
  "text": "But how smart could you actually become?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 229.702,
  "t1": 230.992,
  "text": "Let's talk about Albert Einstein."
 },
 {
  "t0": 231.338,
  "t1": 232.658,
  "text": "Einstein is famous for developing"
 },
 {
  "t0": 232.698,
  "t1": 234.188,
  "text": "the theory of relativity,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 234.278,
  "t1": 235.938,
  "text": "which completely changed how scientists"
 },
 {
  "t0": 235.978,
  "t1": 237.868,
  "text": "understand space and time."
 },
 {
  "t0": 238.072,
  "t1": 239.502,
  "text": "But here's the interesting part."
 },
 {
  "t0": 239.578,
  "t1": 241.158,
  "text": "There is no scientific evidence that"
 },
 {
  "t0": 241.198,
  "t1": 242.738,
  "text": "Einstein used only a certain"
 },
 {
  "t0": 242.778,
  "t1": 244.208,
  "text": "percentage of his brain."
 },
 {
  "t0": 244.402,
  "t1": 245.842,
  "text": "His intelligence wasn't caused by"
 },
 {
  "t0": 245.882,
  "t1": 247.892,
  "text": "unlocking a secret brain region."
 },
 {
  "t0": 248.038,
  "t1": 248.938,
  "text": "It involved extraordinary"
 },
 {
  "t0": 248.978,
  "t1": 250.518,
  "text": "mathematical thinking,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 250.558,
  "t1": 252.128,
  "text": "imagination, curiosity,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 252.338,
  "t1": 253.888,
  "text": "and years of scientific work."
 },
 {
  "t0": 254.8,
  "t1": 256.7,
  "text": "So, if you had an optimized brain,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 256.74,
  "t1": 258.45,
  "text": "would you automatically become Einstein?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 258.828,
  "t1": 260.006,
  "text": "Not necessarily."
 },
 {
  "t0": 260.046,
  "t1": 261.846,
  "text": "Having a powerful computer doesn't mean you"
 },
 {
  "t0": 261.886,
  "t1": 264.196,
  "text": "automatically know how to build a spaceship."
 },
 {
  "t0": 264.27,
  "t1": 265.65,
  "text": "You still need knowledge, experience,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 265.69,
  "t1": 266.653,
  "text": "and practice."
 },
 {
  "t0": 266.693,
  "t1": 268.213,
  "text": "Although, at least now you could understand"
 },
 {
  "t0": 268.253,
  "t1": 270.063,
  "text": "why your computer keeps crashing."
 },
 {
  "t0": 271.3,
  "t1": 272.4,
  "text": "But imagine Einstein had"
 },
 {
  "t0": 272.44,
  "t1": 273.64,
  "text": "your upgraded brain."
 },
 {
  "t0": 273.747,
  "t1": 275.387,
  "text": "He could spend years calculating the"
 },
 {
  "t0": 275.427,
  "t1": 276.837,
  "text": "mysteries of the universe."
 },
 {
  "t0": 277.098,
  "t1": 278.768,
  "text": "Developing complicated equations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 279.115,
  "t1": 280.985,
  "text": "Understanding the nature of time and space."
 },
 {
  "t0": 281.221,
  "t1": 283.111,
  "text": "And then his girlfriend walks into the room."
 },
 {
  "t0": 283.249,
  "t1": 284.719,
  "text": "\"Baby, what are you thinking about?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 284.802,
  "t1": 286.152,
  "text": "\"The curvature of spacetime.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 286.6,
  "t1": 288.37,
  "text": "\"Okay. So you're not thinking about me?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 288.44,
  "t1": 290.23,
  "text": "Einstein might have understood the universe."
 },
 {
  "t0": 290.529,
  "t1": 291.749,
  "text": "But explaining why he didn't text"
 },
 {
  "t0": 291.789,
  "t1": 293.059,
  "text": "back for three hours?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 293.643,
  "t1": 295.233,
  "text": "That's a different theory of relativity."
 },
 {
  "t0": 297.35,
  "t1": 298.35,
  "text": "Now let's move from laboratories"
 },
 {
  "t0": 298.39,
  "t1": 299.8,
  "text": "to the sports field."
 },
 {
  "t0": 299.985,
  "t1": 301.755,
  "text": "Imagine becoming a professional athlete."
 },
 {
  "t0": 301.933,
  "t1": 304.573,
  "text": "Do Olympic athletes use one hundred and"
 },
 {
  "t0": 304.613,
  "t1": 305.813,
  "text": "fifty percent of their brains?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 305.886,
  "t1": 306.816,
  "text": "Of course not."
 },
 {
  "t0": 306.856,
  "t1": 307.816,
  "text": "There is no special brain-power"
 },
 {
  "t0": 307.856,
  "t1": 309.566,
  "text": "percentage for professional athletes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 310.275,
  "t1": 311.615,
  "text": "Their advantage comes from years of"
 },
 {
  "t0": 311.655,
  "t1": 313.325,
  "text": "training that improve coordination,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 313.635,
  "t1": 315.465,
  "text": "timing, reaction, and decision-making."
 },
 {
  "t0": 316.8,
  "t1": 318.05,
  "text": "Take a professional goalkeeper."
 },
 {
  "t0": 318.309,
  "t1": 320.119,
  "text": "When a striker prepares to kick a football,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 320.169,
  "t1": 321.469,
  "text": "the goalkeeper doesn't simply wait"
 },
 {
  "t0": 321.509,
  "t1": 322.819,
  "text": "for the ball to arrive."
 },
 {
  "t0": 322.982,
  "t1": 324.612,
  "text": "Their brain uses visual information,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 324.862,
  "t1": 325.962,
  "text": "body position, movement,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 326.002,
  "t1": 327.422,
  "text": "and experience to anticipate"
 },
 {
  "t0": 327.462,
  "t1": 329.052,
  "text": "where the ball might go."
 },
 {
  "t0": 329.141,
  "t1": 330.821,
  "text": "Now imagine your brain processing those"
 },
 {
  "t0": 330.861,
  "t1": 332.551,
  "text": "patterns much more efficiently."
 },
 {
  "t0": 334.05,
  "t1": 335.8,
  "text": "A football flies toward your face."
 },
 {
  "t0": 336.014,
  "t1": 336.986,
  "text": "You move your head."
 },
 {
  "t0": 337.026,
  "t1": 338.736,
  "text": "The ball misses by a few centimeters."
 },
 {
  "t0": 339.8,
  "t1": 341.03,
  "text": "You catch it with one hand."
 },
 {
  "t0": 341.139,
  "t1": 342.28,
  "text": "Your friends are shocked."
 },
 {
  "t0": 342.32,
  "t1": 343.52,
  "text": "You look at them and say\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 343.834,
  "t1": 344.997,
  "text": "\"That was calculated.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 345.037,
  "t1": 346.727,
  "text": "Then someone throws a pillow at you."
 },
 {
  "t0": 346.791,
  "t1": 347.734,
  "text": "You dodge it."
 },
 {
  "t0": 347.774,
  "t1": 348.974,
  "text": "Someone throws another."
 },
 {
  "t0": 349.036,
  "t1": 350.192,
  "text": "You dodge that too."
 },
 {
  "t0": 350.232,
  "t1": 351.552,
  "text": "Suddenly, your entire family is"
 },
 {
  "t0": 351.592,
  "t1": 352.982,
  "text": "testing your reflexes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 353.06,
  "t1": 354.26,
  "text": "Congratulations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 354.742,
  "t1": 356.312,
  "text": "You've become the household goalkeeper."
 },
 {
  "t0": 357.3,
  "t1": 358.42,
  "text": "But your girlfriend decides to"
 },
 {
  "t0": 358.46,
  "t1": 359.85,
  "text": "test your reflexes too."
 },
 {
  "t0": 360.009,
  "t1": 361.064,
  "text": "She suddenly asks:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 361.104,
  "t1": 362.834,
  "text": "\"Do you remember what day today is?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 363.8,
  "t1": 365.13,
  "text": "Your brain scans the calendar."
 },
 {
  "t0": 365.354,
  "t1": 366.438,
  "text": "Anniversaries."
 },
 {
  "t0": 366.478,
  "t1": 367.374,
  "text": "Birthdays."
 },
 {
  "t0": 367.414,
  "t1": 368.328,
  "text": "First dates."
 },
 {
  "t0": 368.368,
  "t1": 369.494,
  "text": "The day you first met."
 },
 {
  "t0": 369.534,
  "t1": 371.044,
  "text": "The day she first called you handsome."
 },
 {
  "t0": 371.261,
  "t1": 372.221,
  "text": "Within milliseconds, you"
 },
 {
  "t0": 372.261,
  "t1": 373.851,
  "text": "identify the correct answer."
 },
 {
  "t0": 374.041,
  "t1": 375.241,
  "text": "You smile confidently."
 },
 {
  "t0": 375.444,
  "t1": 377.154,
  "text": "\"Of course. It's our six-month anniversary.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 377.405,
  "t1": 378.605,
  "text": "She stares at you."
 },
 {
  "t0": 378.979,
  "t1": 380.179,
  "text": "\"It's our seven-month anniversary.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 380.685,
  "t1": 382.015,
  "text": "Your reflexes were perfect."
 },
 {
  "t0": 382.466,
  "t1": 383.996,
  "text": "Your survival instincts were not."
 },
 {
  "t0": 385.85,
  "t1": 386.87,
  "text": "But perhaps your greatest power"
 },
 {
  "t0": 386.91,
  "t1": 388.54,
  "text": "isn't memory or reaction."
 },
 {
  "t0": 388.809,
  "t1": 389.736,
  "text": "It's learning."
 },
 {
  "t0": 389.776,
  "t1": 390.556,
  "text": "Your brain has something"
 },
 {
  "t0": 390.596,
  "t1": 392.126,
  "text": "called neuroplasticity."
 },
 {
  "t0": 392.187,
  "t1": 393.947,
  "text": "This is the ability of your brain to change"
 },
 {
  "t0": 393.987,
  "t1": 396.107,
  "text": "and reorganize its connections as you learn"
 },
 {
  "t0": 396.147,
  "t1": 397.817,
  "text": "and experience new things."
 },
 {
  "t0": 398.065,
  "t1": 399.425,
  "text": "Every time you practice something,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 399.465,
  "t1": 400.665,
  "text": "your brain adapts."
 },
 {
  "t0": 401.3,
  "t1": 402.77,
  "text": "Think about learning a new language."
 },
 {
  "t0": 402.987,
  "t1": 404.837,
  "text": "Normally, you struggle with pronunciation,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 405.067,
  "t1": 406.957,
  "text": "grammar, and remembering vocabulary."
 },
 {
  "t0": 407.363,
  "t1": 408.923,
  "text": "You spend hours trying to understand the"
 },
 {
  "t0": 408.963,
  "t1": 410.043,
  "text": "difference between \"their\","
 },
 {
  "t0": 410.083,
  "t1": 411.043,
  "text": "\"there\", and \"they're\"."
 },
 {
  "t0": 411.083,
  "t1": 412.123,
  "text": "Your brain starts questioning"
 },
 {
  "t0": 412.163,
  "t1": 413.363,
  "text": "your life choices."
 },
 {
  "t0": 413.466,
  "t1": 415.276,
  "text": "But imagine learning much more efficiently."
 },
 {
  "t0": 415.559,
  "t1": 417.539,
  "text": "You recognize patterns in sentences,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 417.579,
  "t1": 419.579,
  "text": "connect new words with existing knowledge,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 419.619,
  "t1": 420.459,
  "text": "and improve your pronunciation"
 },
 {
  "t0": 420.499,
  "t1": 421.869,
  "text": "through practice."
 },
 {
  "t0": 422.085,
  "t1": 423.585,
  "text": "You could become conversational in a"
 },
 {
  "t0": 423.625,
  "t1": 425.095,
  "text": "new language much faster."
 },
 {
  "t0": 426.3,
  "t1": 428.03,
  "text": "You walk into a Japanese restaurant."
 },
 {
  "t0": 428.23,
  "t1": 429.74,
  "text": "You confidently order your food."
 },
 {
  "t0": 429.859,
  "t1": 431.349,
  "text": "The waiter responds in Japanese."
 },
 {
  "t0": 431.653,
  "t1": 432.853,
  "text": "You understand everything."
 },
 {
  "t0": 432.972,
  "t1": 434.982,
  "text": "Then he asks whether you want extra wasabi."
 },
 {
  "t0": 435.173,
  "t1": 436.723,
  "text": "Your brain processes the information."
 },
 {
  "t0": 437.09,
  "t1": 438.5,
  "text": "You confidently say yes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 439.126,
  "t1": 440.006,
  "text": "Five seconds later, your"
 },
 {
  "t0": 440.046,
  "t1": 441.556,
  "text": "entire face turns red."
 },
 {
  "t0": 441.646,
  "t1": 443.026,
  "text": "Apparently, intelligence doesn't"
 },
 {
  "t0": 443.066,
  "t1": 444.266,
  "text": "protect your tongue."
 },
 {
  "t0": 444.8,
  "t1": 445.832,
  "text": "But that's not all."
 },
 {
  "t0": 445.872,
  "t1": 446.592,
  "text": "You decide to learn the"
 },
 {
  "t0": 446.632,
  "t1": 447.942,
  "text": "language of relationships."
 },
 {
  "t0": 448.319,
  "t1": 449.439,
  "text": "You study psychology,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 449.479,
  "t1": 450.559,
  "text": "emotional intelligence,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 450.599,
  "t1": 452.419,
  "text": "facial expressions, body language,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 452.459,
  "t1": 453.586,
  "text": "and communication."
 },
 {
  "t0": 453.626,
  "t1": 455.296,
  "text": "You analyze thousands of conversations."
 },
 {
  "t0": 455.735,
  "t1": 457.705,
  "text": "You build a database of emotional patterns."
 },
 {
  "t0": 458.004,
  "t1": 459.714,
  "text": "Finally, you think you've cracked the code."
 },
 {
  "t0": 459.848,
  "t1": 460.978,
  "text": "Your girlfriend says:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 461.018,
  "t1": 462.011,
  "text": "\"Nothing's wrong.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 462.051,
  "t1": 463.261,
  "text": "You confidently respond:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 463.474,
  "t1": 465.354,
  "text": "\"Based on your facial expression, tone,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 465.394,
  "t1": 466.534,
  "text": "and previous behavior,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 466.574,
  "t1": 467.944,
  "text": "I believe something is wrong.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 468.089,
  "t1": 469.289,
  "text": "She looks at you."
 },
 {
  "t0": 469.476,
  "t1": 471.326,
  "text": "\"Wow. So now I'm not allowed to have feelings?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 471.567,
  "t1": 472.447,
  "text": "You have successfully learned"
 },
 {
  "t0": 472.487,
  "t1": 473.687,
  "text": "twelve languages."
 },
 {
  "t0": 473.805,
  "t1": 474.845,
  "text": "But the language of \"nothing's"
 },
 {
  "t0": 474.885,
  "t1": 476.535,
  "text": "wrong\" remains undocumented."
 },
 {
  "t0": 478.85,
  "t1": 480.28,
  "text": "But there's one tiny problem."
 },
 {
  "t0": 480.444,
  "t1": 481.364,
  "text": "Your brain is already an"
 },
 {
  "t0": 481.404,
  "t1": 482.604,
  "text": "energy-hungry organ."
 },
 {
  "t0": 482.87,
  "t1": 484.39,
  "text": "Although it makes up only about two"
 },
 {
  "t0": 484.43,
  "t1": 485.63,
  "text": "percent of your body weight,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 485.67,
  "t1": 487.09,
  "text": "it uses roughly twenty percent of"
 },
 {
  "t0": 487.13,
  "t1": 488.58,
  "text": "your body's energy at rest."
 },
 {
  "t0": 488.776,
  "t1": 489.956,
  "text": "That's a lot of electricity for"
 },
 {
  "t0": 489.996,
  "t1": 491.776,
  "text": "something that sometimes forgets why"
 },
 {
  "t0": 491.816,
  "t1": 493.326,
  "text": "you opened the refrigerator."
 },
 {
  "t0": 493.605,
  "t1": 495.425,
  "text": "Now imagine making your brain work even"
 },
 {
  "t0": 495.465,
  "t1": 497.235,
  "text": "more efficiently and intensely."
 },
 {
  "t0": 497.511,
  "t1": 499.511,
  "text": "Your body still needs oxygen, glucose,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 499.551,
  "t1": 501.191,
  "text": "blood flow, and the right balance of"
 },
 {
  "t0": 501.231,
  "t1": 503.261,
  "text": "chemicals to keep everything functioning."
 },
 {
  "t0": 503.439,
  "t1": 504.319,
  "text": "You can't just turn your brain"
 },
 {
  "t0": 504.359,
  "t1": 505.779,
  "text": "into a supercomputer and expect"
 },
 {
  "t0": 505.819,
  "t1": 507.289,
  "text": "your body to keep up."
 },
 {
  "t0": 507.456,
  "t1": 509.256,
  "text": "You might need more energy, better sleep,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 509.296,
  "t1": 510.496,
  "text": "and plenty of recovery."
 },
 {
  "t0": 510.602,
  "t1": 512.462,
  "text": "And no, drinking seventeen energy drinks"
 },
 {
  "t0": 512.502,
  "t1": 513.892,
  "text": "won't turn you into Einstein."
 },
 {
  "t0": 514.568,
  "t1": 515.708,
  "text": "It will probably just turn your"
 },
 {
  "t0": 515.748,
  "t1": 517.318,
  "text": "heart into a washing machine."
 },
 {
  "t0": 518.25,
  "t1": 519.01,
  "text": "Meanwhile, your girlfriend"
 },
 {
  "t0": 519.05,
  "t1": 520.38,
  "text": "sends another message."
 },
 {
  "t0": 521.089,
  "t1": 522.289,
  "text": "\"Can we talk?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 522.8,
  "t1": 523.98,
  "text": "Your brain immediately activates"
 },
 {
  "t0": 524.02,
  "t1": 525.77,
  "text": "every available resource."
 },
 {
  "t0": 526.037,
  "t1": 526.917,
  "text": "The memory system starts"
 },
 {
  "t0": 526.957,
  "t1": 528.507,
  "text": "reviewing your past mistakes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 528.72,
  "t1": 529.82,
  "text": "The emotional system detects"
 },
 {
  "t0": 529.86,
  "t1": 531.09,
  "text": "possible danger."
 },
 {
  "t0": 531.364,
  "t1": 532.464,
  "text": "The reasoning system calculates"
 },
 {
  "t0": 532.504,
  "t1": 533.814,
  "text": "possible outcomes."
 },
 {
  "t0": 534.061,
  "t1": 535.271,
  "text": "Your body starts sweating."
 },
 {
  "t0": 535.478,
  "t1": 537.238,
  "text": "Your brain is now using more processing"
 },
 {
  "t0": 537.278,
  "t1": 539.328,
  "text": "power than a NASA supercomputer."
 },
 {
  "t0": 539.492,
  "t1": 540.394,
  "text": "And all of this\u2026"
 },
 {
  "t0": 540.434,
  "t1": 542.104,
  "text": "For a conversation that starts with:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 543.05,
  "t1": 544.8,
  "text": "\"Why did you like her Instagram picture?\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 546.85,
  "t1": 547.63,
  "text": "And here's where things get"
 },
 {
  "t0": 547.67,
  "t1": 548.87,
  "text": "really interesting."
 },
 {
  "t0": 548.928,
  "t1": 550.288,
  "text": "What if you literally forced one"
 },
 {
  "t0": 550.328,
  "t1": 551.808,
  "text": "hundred percent of your neurons to"
 },
 {
  "t0": 551.848,
  "t1": 553.048,
  "text": "fire simultaneously?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 553.342,
  "t1": 554.542,
  "text": "Would you become a god?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 554.842,
  "t1": 555.955,
  "text": "Absolutely not."
 },
 {
  "t0": 555.995,
  "t1": 557.885,
  "text": "Your brain doesn't work like a light switch."
 },
 {
  "t0": 558.106,
  "t1": 558.926,
  "text": "Different groups of neurons"
 },
 {
  "t0": 558.966,
  "t1": 560.566,
  "text": "perform different jobs,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 560.606,
  "t1": 562.306,
  "text": "communicating through carefully coordinated"
 },
 {
  "t0": 562.346,
  "t1": 564.596,
  "text": "electrical and chemical signals."
 },
 {
  "t0": 565.8,
  "t1": 567.71,
  "text": "Think of your brain as a massive orchestra."
 },
 {
  "t0": 567.938,
  "t1": 569.298,
  "text": "The violin, drums, piano,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 569.338,
  "t1": 570.968,
  "text": "and trumpet all have different roles."
 },
 {
  "t0": 571.185,
  "t1": 572.825,
  "text": "Now imagine forcing every musician"
 },
 {
  "t0": 572.865,
  "t1": 574.765,
  "text": "to play as loudly as possible at"
 },
 {
  "t0": 574.805,
  "t1": 576.315,
  "text": "exactly the same time."
 },
 {
  "t0": 576.43,
  "t1": 577.341,
  "text": "No rhythm."
 },
 {
  "t0": 577.381,
  "t1": 578.581,
  "text": "No coordination."
 },
 {
  "t0": 579.014,
  "t1": 580.009,
  "text": "Just noise."
 },
 {
  "t0": 580.049,
  "t1": 581.249,
  "text": "That's not intelligence."
 },
 {
  "t0": 581.386,
  "t1": 582.586,
  "text": "That's a musical disaster."
 },
 {
  "t0": 583.8,
  "t1": 584.78,
  "text": "In reality, uncontrolled"
 },
 {
  "t0": 584.82,
  "t1": 586.86,
  "text": "synchronized electrical activity in"
 },
 {
  "t0": 586.9,
  "t1": 588.41,
  "text": "the brain can cause seizures."
 },
 {
  "t0": 588.655,
  "t1": 589.855,
  "text": "So the goal isn't to make every"
 },
 {
  "t0": 589.895,
  "t1": 591.305,
  "text": "neuron fire at once."
 },
 {
  "t0": 591.507,
  "t1": 592.547,
  "text": "It's to make the right neurons"
 },
 {
  "t0": 592.587,
  "t1": 594.397,
  "text": "communicate at the right time."
 },
 {
  "t0": 595.3,
  "t1": 596.6,
  "text": "And this is exactly what happens"
 },
 {
  "t0": 596.64,
  "t1": 597.95,
  "text": "when your girlfriend says:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 598.519,
  "t1": 599.504,
  "text": "\"We need to talk.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 599.544,
  "t1": 600.884,
  "text": "Your memory starts playing every"
 },
 {
  "t0": 600.924,
  "t1": 602.894,
  "text": "argument from the last five years."
 },
 {
  "t0": 603.101,
  "t1": 604.561,
  "text": "Your imagination creates seventeen"
 },
 {
  "t0": 604.601,
  "t1": 606.371,
  "text": "different disaster scenarios."
 },
 {
  "t0": 606.629,
  "t1": 607.769,
  "text": "Your reasoning tries to identify"
 },
 {
  "t0": 607.809,
  "t1": 609.139,
  "text": "what you did wrong."
 },
 {
  "t0": 609.257,
  "t1": 610.927,
  "text": "Your emotional system activates."
 },
 {
  "t0": 611.135,
  "t1": 612.715,
  "text": "And your entire brain becomes one"
 },
 {
  "t0": 612.755,
  "t1": 614.505,
  "text": "giant emergency meeting."
 },
 {
  "t0": 614.654,
  "t1": 615.854,
  "text": "All neurons are working."
 },
 {
  "t0": 616.25,
  "t1": 617.45,
  "text": "None of them has a solution."
 },
 {
  "t0": 619.35,
  "t1": 621.01,
  "text": "So, would unlocking one hundred"
 },
 {
  "t0": 621.05,
  "t1": 622.39,
  "text": "percent of your brain make you the"
 },
 {
  "t0": 622.43,
  "t1": 623.63,
  "text": "smartest human alive?"
 },
 {
  "t0": 623.696,
  "t1": 624.838,
  "text": "Not automatically."
 },
 {
  "t0": 624.878,
  "t1": 626.588,
  "text": "Because intelligence isn't a percentage."
 },
 {
  "t0": 626.937,
  "t1": 628.817,
  "text": "It's a combination of memory, learning,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 628.857,
  "t1": 630.877,
  "text": "reasoning, creativity, experience,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 630.917,
  "t1": 632.017,
  "text": "and how efficiently your brain"
 },
 {
  "t0": 632.057,
  "t1": 633.257,
  "text": "uses information."
 },
 {
  "t0": 633.523,
  "t1": 635.513,
  "text": "Einstein didn't need a secret brain switch."
 },
 {
  "t0": 635.725,
  "t1": 636.805,
  "text": "Professional athletes didn't"
 },
 {
  "t0": 636.845,
  "t1": 638.415,
  "text": "unlock hidden brain regions."
 },
 {
  "t0": 638.672,
  "t1": 639.492,
  "text": "They developed extraordinary"
 },
 {
  "t0": 639.532,
  "t1": 641.252,
  "text": "abilities through practice,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 641.292,
  "t1": 642.622,
  "text": "experience, and dedication."
 },
 {
  "t0": 643.8,
  "t1": 645.55,
  "text": "And perhaps the greatest lesson is this:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 645.697,
  "t1": 646.597,
  "text": "You might be able to solve"
 },
 {
  "t0": 646.637,
  "t1": 648.037,
  "text": "complicated equations,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 648.077,
  "t1": 649.297,
  "text": "memorize thousands of books,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 649.337,
  "t1": 650.947,
  "text": "predict the movement of a football,"
 },
 {
  "t0": 651.017,
  "t1": 651.937,
  "text": "and understand the mysteries"
 },
 {
  "t0": 651.977,
  "t1": 653.177,
  "text": "of the universe."
 },
 {
  "t0": 653.286,
  "t1": 654.996,
  "text": "But when your girlfriend says:"
 },
 {
  "t0": 655.186,
  "t1": 656.372,
  "text": "\"Do whatever you want.\""
 },
 {
  "t0": 656.412,
  "t1": 657.792,
  "text": "Even a supercomputer might need"
 },
 {
  "t0": 657.832,
  "t1": 659.032,
  "text": "professional help."
 },
 {
